{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["The cave of Machpelah — the entire basin is called Machpelah, just as: ככר הירדן, and so it proves for us: שדה עפרון אשר במכפלה." "In full silver — at its full value." "Among you — before your eyes, and you shall be witnesses." "For a possession of a grave — that you all consent to bury my dead in it."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:48.546793130Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}